       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · India Today · 2026-10-20 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Gujarat Government Allots Disputed Vadodara Plot to Yusuf Pathan</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Gujarat government has approved the allotment of a 978-square-meter disputed plot in Vadodara to former cricketer and Lok Sabha MP Yusuf Pathan. The land, situated adjacent to Pathan's Tandalja residence, is valued at approximately Rs 20.53 crore, or Rs 2.10 lakh per square meter. Final approval is currently pending to clear the way for possession.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-20/gujarat-government-allots-disputed-vadodara-plot-to-yusuf-pa.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>This development follows a 14-year hiatus in the allotment process. Pathan, the MP for Baharampur, West Bengal, recently broke away from the Trinamool Congress alongside 19 other rebel MPs to align with the NCPI. The proposal will now move to the Vadodara Municipal Corporation's Standing Committee for final processing.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief is concise, accurate, and includes all key figures and context provided by the source.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/yusuf-patha-vadodara-plot-gujarat-bjp-government-clears-disputed-land-possession-after-his-tmc-exit-3021148-2026-10-20?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       <div class="cityguide"><b>City guide</b><p>More on <a href="https://bharatdn.com/city/vadodara/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vadodara</a> - census 2011 population, live weather and air quality, local food and getaways.</p></div>
