     <article class="story single" data-beat="entertainment">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">ENTERTAINMENT</span> · Bollywood Hungama · 2026-10-20 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Himesh Reshammiya to Compose Music for Naam – To Live Is War</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Composer Himesh Reshammiya has joined the 2027 film Naam – To Live Is War, marking a 16-year reunion with presenter Mahesh Bhatt. Reshammiya will also release the film’s music under his label, Himesh Reshammiya Melodies. The intense feature stars Veer Pahariya in the lead, with Varun Sharma cast in his first negative role alongside Prashant Narayanan, Vijayant Kohli, and Shefali Bagga.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-20/himesh-reshammiya-to-compose-music-for-naam-to-live-is-war.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Directed by Sidhaant Sachdev and produced by Utsav Upadhyay and Riddhi Chawda, the film follows Pahariya's previous roles in Sky Force and Prem Keetanu. Reshammiya, who previously collaborated with Bhatt on Footpath and Kajraare, was selected for his ability to match the project's thematic intensity.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief effectively summarizes the casting and musical collaboration details while maintaining the required brevity.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/bollywood/exclusive-himesh-reshammiya-to-compose-music-for-veer-pahariyas-naam-to-live-is-war-reunites-with-mahesh-bhatt-after-16-years/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
