     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · News18 India · 2026-10-20 · editor 9/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span><span class="badge conf" title="Reported by News18 India, India Today">confirmed by 2 sources</span></div>
       <h1>Model Shraddha Dubey and Two Others Arrested in Shiva Sharma Death Case</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>Model and social media influencer Shraddha Dubey, her sister Rashmi, and driver Tanveer Ali alias Danish were arrested in Nagpur after an 11-day manhunt. The arrests follow the October 9 death of businessman Shiva Sharma, who fell from the fourth floor of Awadh Green Apartments in Lucknow's Hazratganj area. Sharma's mother filed a complaint alleging her son faced months of physical violence, threats, and blackmail from Dubey and others. Lucknow Police and the Uttar Pradesh STF launched the interstate manhunt after Dubey became untraceable, eventually doubling the reward for information to Rs 50,000.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-20/model-shraddha-dubey-and-two-others-arrested-in-shiva-sharma.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async">
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Comprehensive summary of the arrest and background context; note that the source text provided in the prompt is sufficient to support the claims.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source · also covered by 1 more</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.news18.com/india/shiva-sharma-death-case-model-shraddha-dubey-sister-and-driver-arrested-after-11-day-manhunt-10390170.html" rel="noopener">News18 India</a></li><li><a href="https://www.indiatoday.in/india/story/model-shraddha-dubey-prime-accused-in-shiva-sharma-murder-case-arrested-in-nagpur-3021337-2026-10-20?utm_source=rss" rel="noopener">India Today</a></li></ul>
      <p>This brief was written from the original report. The same event was independently covered by the other outlets listed here.</p>
    </div>
       
